; claude: the puzzle kit (see docs/claude_notes/plan_games.md, section 7,
; and "kits"): what grid puzzles share, on top of the playground --
; moving and pushing on a grid (Push), and going back (Puzzle_undo); and
; Sokoban, the rules, level format and solver that TinySokoban shares
; with its level editor, TinySokobanEd. Used by TinySokoban,
; TinySokobanEd and TinyBabaIsYou. A private library (only the
; games use it), installed with elm_playground for its API documentation.
